'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Distributed to all present and future Helldivers as of October 27, 2024, along with the [[R-2124 Constitution|Constitution]] rifle, to celebrate [[Liberty Day]].

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Democracy Protects}}

==Lore==
'''DP-00''' is a modernized version of [[Helldivers 1:Armor#Tactical|Mk-5 Tactical]] from ''[[Helldivers 1]]'', the predecessor of [[B-01 Tactical|B-01]]. It is aptly designated as “00,” being the first armor created for the Helldivers.

